This is the GAT counterpart to phase5_fault_injection.log. Both suites now
run in the same test binary (`cargo test --test fault_injection` executes
both `#[test]` functions with no filter change), exercising
AtomicCommitter::commit's two dispatch arms separately:
aggregate_over_subgraph (GraphSAGE/GCN) and gat_incremental_update (GAT).
